      "writtenOn": "2016-08-16T01:52:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this is to distinguish FMP from regular. Three are 3 regular and 1 FMP, it seems like specifying it in the i2c port declaration is most readable, although it wastes a few bytes on other systems.",
